---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — QuickChartMaker"
  description="Privacy policy for QuickChartMaker — how we handle your data."
>
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 space-y-4">
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> April 2026</p>

    <h2 class="text-base font-black text-slate-800">Your data stays in your browser</h2>
    <p>
      QuickChartMaker runs entirely in your browser. Any data you enter into the chart tool is never
      sent to our servers. We do not collect, store, or share your chart data.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-base font-black text-slate-800">Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      This site uses Google AdSense to display advertisements. Google AdSense uses cookies to serve
      ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalised
      advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" class="text-slate-800 underline">Google Ads Settings</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-base font-black text-slate-800">Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site (pages visited, time on site).
      This data is aggregated and anonymous.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-base font-black text-slate-800">Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      Cookies are used by Google AdSense and Google Analytics. By using this site you consent to
      the use of these cookies in accordance with this policy.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-base font-black text-slate-800">Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:majidrajpar@gmail.com" class="text-slate-800 underline">majidrajpar@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
